, both of which provide expanded income streams. We expect these benefits to continue …", "a": "John B. Dicus, Chairman and CEO, stated", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1490906/000149090626000004/earningsrelease1225.htm"}, {"d": "2025-10-29", "n": 0.99, "z": null, "rz": 2.43, "earn": true, "q": "We are delivering value to stockholders through a more diversified balance sheet, expanded income streams, and diligent credit risk management. We expect the pace of the past two years to continue as we roll out more products and services and add to an already seasoned team of professionals focused on driving our comme…", "a": "John B. Dicus, Chairman and CEO stated that", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1490906/000149090625000027/earningsrelease0925.htm"}, {"d": "2018-09-05", "n": 1.03, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "Today marks a special milestone in Capitol Federal's history and we are excited to welcome the customers and employees of Capital City Bank to Capitol Federal Savings. Capital City Bank has a long history of building a conservative, customer focused community bank, which we look forward to integrating to provide the fu…", "a": "John B. Dicus, President and Chief Executive Officer of Capitol Federal said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1490906/000149090618000056/ccbacquisition0918.htm"}, {"d": "2018-04-30", "n": 2.37, "z": null, "rz": -0.46, "earn": true, "q": "We are pleased to be merging with Capital City Bank to introduce a full commercial banking experience to our customer base and communities. Capital City Bank has a long history of building a conservative, customer focused community bank, with an overlapping geographic focus in markets highly familiar to us - Topeka, La…", "a": "John B. Dicus, Chairman and President of Capitol Federal, stated", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1490906/000149090618000028/earningsrelease0318.htm"}], "now": {"d": "2026-10-28", "z": 0.61, "mood": "u